# Raw scrape caches. Kept on disk deliberately — re-parsing must never require
# re-fetching, and on 2026-08-06 old caches were the only reason the catalogue
# could be rebuilt after the Railway database was lost. But they are tens of
# megabytes of third-party HTML that would sit in git history forever, and the
# processed result is already versioned in web/data/checkup_db.json.
site_cache/
hdmall_cache/

# Apify export (~4 MB). Regenerate by re-running the actor; the imported result
# is in the committed dataset.
apify_dataset.json

# Database dumps from backup_db.py.
backups/

# Scraper stdout, kept locally for debugging.
*.log
deploy_log.txt

# Contains a Vercel deploy token in plain text. Keep it local; never commit a
# credential to a file git tracks.
deploy_bangkoktopclinic.bat
